WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.353
Anthropology is the study of

2
00:00:02.353 --> 00:00:03.860
humans. All of us,

3
00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:05.695
in every time and place.

4
00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:09.283
Social-cultural anthropology studies how people

5
00:00:09.283 --> 00:00:11.656
live. Biological anthropology,

6
00:00:11.656 --> 00:00:14.015
our evolution and variation.

7
00:00:14.015 --> 00:00:16.015
Archaeology, the past through what's

8
00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:16.825
left behind.

9
00:00:16.825 --> 00:00:18.721
And linguistic anthropology,

10
00:00:18.721 --> 00:00:20.555
language in society.

11
00:00:20.896 --> 00:00:23.504
Its hallmark is holism: seeing

12
00:00:23.504 --> 00:00:26.069
body, culture and history together.

13
00:00:26.758 --> 00:00:28.819
It overlaps with sociology and

14
00:00:28.819 --> 00:00:31.170
history, and with biology and

15
00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:32.384
psychology.

16
00:00:32.738 --> 00:00:33.915
Your turn.

17
00:00:33.915 --> 00:00:35.755
Which isn't a field?
